text Route110_Text_MauvilleCitySign {
    format("ROUTE 110 {UP_ARROW} MAUVILLE CITY")
}

text Route110_Text_TrainerTipsPrlzSleep {
    format("TRAINER TIPS\p The foe can be made helpless by paralyzing it or causing it to sleep.\p It is an important technique for POKéMON battles.")
}

text Route110_Text_TrickHouseSign {
    format("“Three steps {RIGHT_ARROW} and two steps {UP_ARROW} to reach the wondrous TRICK HOUSE.”")
}

text Route110_Text_BestRecord {
    format("THE BEST RECORD TO DATE…\p No. of collisions: {STR_VAR_1}\p Elapsed time: {STR_VAR_2}")
}

text Route110_Text_AquaWasHere {
    format("“TEAM AQUA was here!”\p Someone painted that onto this sign, but then someone else painted over it.\p “TEAM MAGMA rules!” is what it says now.")
}

text Route110_Text_CyclingRoadSign {
    format("SEASIDE CYCLING ROAD")
}

text Route110_Text_SlateportCitySign {
    format("ROUTE 110 {DOWN_ARROW} SLATEPORT CITY")
}

text Route110_Text_SeasideParkingSign {
    format("SEASIDE PARKING")
}

text Route110_Text_TrainerTipsRegisterItems {
    format("TRAINER TIPS\p The items in the BAG can be reorganized by pressing SELECT.")
}

text Route110_Text_Route103Sign {
    format("ROUTE 110 {LEFT_ARROW} ROUTE 103")
}


text Route110_Text_AbigailDefeated {
    "POKéMON battles are hard, too!"
}

text Route110_Text_AbigailIntro {
    "The triathlon is hard in the extreme.\pYou have to complete the three events\nof swimming, cycling, and running."
}

text Route110_Text_AbigailPostBattle {
    "I'm exhausted, so I need a break.\nIt's important to get proper rest."
}

text Route110_Text_AlyssaDefeated {
    "Oops!\nI ended up losing!"
}

text Route110_Text_AlyssaIntro {
    "I fell off CYCLING ROAD…\pI'll get over my embarrassment by\nbattling with you!"
}

text Route110_Text_AlyssaPostBattle {
    "Falling… Losing…\nThis is so humiliating for me!"
}

text Route110_Text_AnthonyDefeated {
    "Crash and burn!"
}

text Route110_Text_AnthonyIntro {
    "Yo, you!\nCan you keep up with my speed?"
}

text Route110_Text_AnthonyPostBattle {
    "Speed alone won't let me win at POKéMON.\nI need to reconsider this…"
}

text Route110_Text_BenjaminDefeated {
    "I shouldn't panic during POKéMON\nbattles…"
}

text Route110_Text_BenjaminIntro {
    "Don't panic if your BIKE's going fast!"
}

text Route110_Text_BenjaminPostBattle {
    "There's no need to panic or stress.\nTake it easy. There's plenty of time."
}

text Route110_Text_DaleDefeated {
    "I lost!\nDrat!"
}

text Route110_Text_DaleIntro {
    "Hey!\nDon't sneak up behind me like that!"
}

text Route110_Text_DalePostBattle {
    "Fishing is all about concentration.\nYou have to focus on the floater."
}

text Route110_Text_EdwardDefeated {
    "I failed to prophesize my own demise!"
}

text Route110_Text_EdwardIntro {
    "I have foreseen your intentions!\nI cannot possibly lose!"
}

text Route110_Text_EdwardPostBattle {
    "I see your future…\pHmm…\nI see a shining light…"
}

text Route110_Text_EdwinDefeated {
    "I wanted to complete\nmy collection…"
}

text Route110_Text_EdwinIntro {
    "Could I see your POKéMON?\nJust one look, please?"
}

text Route110_Text_EdwinPostBattle {
    "When I see a POKéMON that I don't know,\nmy passion as a collector is ignited!"
}

text Route110_Text_IsabelDefeated {
    "Oh, dear, this won't do."
}

text Route110_Text_IsabelIntro {
    "Ahahaha! I would go anywhere to show\noff my delightful POKéMON."
}

text Route110_Text_IsabelPostBattle {
    "Rather than battling, perhaps I should\nshow off my POKéMON at the FAN CLUB."
}

text Route110_Text_JaclynDefeated {
    "I wondrously lost!"
}

text Route110_Text_JaclynIntro {
    "Ahahahaha!\nI'll dazzle you with my wonders!"
}

text Route110_Text_JaclynPostBattle {
    "You managed to win only because it was\na wonder! Yes, a wonder!\nDon't think you can win all the time!"
}

text Route110_Text_JacobDefeated {
    "Whoa!\nMy brakes failed!"
}

text Route110_Text_JacobIntro {
    "Whoa! Watch it!\nI guess you're not used to BIKE racing."
}

text Route110_Text_JacobPostBattle {
    "Flat tires and brake problems can\ncause serious injury!\nInspect your BIKE for problems!"
}

text Route110_Text_JasmineDefeated {
    "I'm worried about muscle cramps…"
}

text Route110_Text_JasmineIntro {
    "I've been riding without stopping.\nMy thighs are like rocks!"
}

text Route110_Text_JasminePostBattle {
    "Oh, you have some GYM BADGES?\nNo wonder you're so strong!"
}

text Route110_Text_JosephDefeated {
    "You got into the groove all right…"
}

text Route110_Text_JosephIntro {
    "Okay! Full-throttle time! If you can't\ngroove, you get left behind!"
}

text Route110_Text_JosephPostBattle {
    "This isn't going to bring me down!\nLosing has made me a better man!"
}

text Route110_Text_KalebDefeated {
    "Have you no compassion or pity?"
}

text Route110_Text_KalebIntro {
    "When cute POKéMON help each other…\nYou won't see a more adorable sight!"
}

text Route110_Text_KalebPostBattle {
    "Okay, okay, you've done the best you\ncould, my pretties."
}

text Route110_Text_TimmyDefeated {
    "Being cool isn't enough to win…"
}

text Route110_Text_TimmyIntro {
    "I found some cool POKéMON in the grass\naround here!"
}

text Route110_Text_TimmyPostBattle {
    "It's hard to battle with POKéMON you\njust caught."
}